					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. P. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scripsi ad te superioribus diebus, pater colendissime, de consilio profectionis <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>meę ad <placeName ref="l367">Aureliam</placeName> vel in <placeName ref="l2705">Aquitaniam</placeName>; sed partim propter annonae caritatem, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>partim propter horribiles seditiosorum hominum tumultus passim in <placeName ref="l2705">Aquitania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>motos <placeName ref="l378">Parisiis</placeName> haerere coactus sum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Interim ossiologiam <persName ref="p19897">Galeni</persName>, qu<lb xml:id="p1z5"/>am <persName ref="p21244">Pet<lb xml:id="p1z6"/>rus Sylvius</persName>, regius medicinę professor interpretatus est, quoniam ad studiorum <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>meorum rationes conferre videbatur, audivi et didici.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Cui adiunxi <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>libros de partibus animalium <persName ref="p18432">Aristotelis</persName>, quo mihi ad nobiles illos <persName ref="p19897">Galeni</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>de usu partium libros aditum pararem viamque sternerem, quos nuper <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p21244">Sylvius</persName> interpretari coepit.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Qui, si non aliam ob causam, saltem ob hanc, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quod theologicę lectionis instar esse possint, diligenter cognoscendi sunt.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Reli<lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quum temporis totum in <placeName ref="l2531">Graecis</placeName> literis consumitur, id quod mihi non <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>inutile fore intelligo, si theologiae sacra studia <placeName ref="l491">Argentinae</placeName> olim coepta de<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>nuo redintegrare et continuare velim.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Vivo nunc non perinde magnis <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>sumptibus; nam in convictores idoneos incidi.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Sed haec de studiorum et vitę ratione.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Puto <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>te multa nova e <placeName ref="l832">Gallia</placeName> expectare; verum te dignum nihil occurrit<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z18"/>Idem est ecclesię status, qui semper fuit, nisi quod verę religionis confessores <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>aliquamdiu in summa tranquillitate vixerunt, id quod deo, pacis authori, non <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>tyrannicis sacrificulis acceptum referimus.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Tumultus <placeName ref="l2705">Aquitanici</placeName> regis dexteritate <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>compositi sunt.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De seditionis authoribus atrocissimum supplicium <placeName ref="l1765">Burdegalę</placeName> sumptum <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>esse accepimus.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Praeterea nihil habeo; quamprimum se aliquid obtulerit, quod <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>ad cogitationes tuas pertinere videatur, te faciam certiorem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Dominus te ad nostrę <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>ecclesię aedificationem diu incolumem servare dignetur.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Parentibus meis, uxori tuę, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>liberis totique familię meo nomine plurimam salutem dicere ne graveris.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l378">Parisiis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>ex musęo nostro pridie nonas Decembris 1548.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z27"/>Tuus ex animo <persName ref="p1884">Ludovicus Lavaterus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z28"/><placeName ref="l587">Tigurinus</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/><persName ref="p495">Henrico Bullingero</persName>, <placeName ref="l587">Tigu<lb xml:id="p2z2"/>rinę</placeName> civitatis pastori doctissimo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>et vigilantissimo, patri suo <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>colendissimo.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z5"/>An herren <persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName>.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z6"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
